      <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M9 5H7a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v12a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h10a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V7a2 2 0 0 0-2-2h-2M9 5a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h2a2 2 0 0 0 2-2M9 5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h2a2 2 0 0 1 2 2" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
      Offers &amp; Deals
